# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# DB-030/DB-021: a window entry raises its window and CMD+click minimizes
# it -- reachable at last: a CMD press on the bar is ARMED for the dock
# drag and delivered as the chord only when it never moves.
wait 12
note the folder window is up, nothing minimized
expect-said minimized
click 932 60 1 ctrl
wait 20
note CMD+click on its Deskbar entry minimized it
expect-said minimized trk_script|
click 932 60 1
wait 20
note and a plain click on the same entry brings it back
expect-said minimized
quit
